</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">y</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><span class=\"fn\">j</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a>)</div></div>","info":{"doc":"Element `(i, j)` of `ger α x y A` is `A[i, j]` when `α = 0` or `y[j] = 0`, and\n`A[i, j] + x[i] * (α * y[j])` otherwise.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float64/Level2.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat.getElem_ger","kind":"theorem","line":722,"name":"BLAS.Float64.Mat.getElem_ger","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float64/Level2.lean#L722-L734"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Level2.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat.ld_ger\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float64</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">ld_ger</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Vec.html#BLAS.Float64.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">y</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Vec.html#BLAS.Float64.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Mat.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span