an class=\"name\">gemv</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Mat.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Vec.html#BLAS.Float64.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">y</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Vec.html#BLAS.Float64.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Vec.html#BLAS.Float64.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`gemv α A x β y` is `α * A * x + β * y`, with the operations of the reference BLAS, in its order\nfor each element: it scales `y` by `β`, then adds `α * x[j]` times column `j` of `A`, for\n`j = 0, …, n - 1`. It adds four columns in each pass over `y`, which gives the same result with a\nquarter of the reads and writes of `y`. As in the reference BLAS, it returns `y` when `n = 0`, sets\n`y` to `0` without reading it when `β = 0`, and only scales `y` when `α = 0`, without reading `A`\nor `x`. It updates `y` in place when its array is not shared, and leaves the elements of the array\noutside `y` unchanged.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float64/Level2.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat.gemv","kind":"def","line":252,"name":"BLAS.Float64.Mat.gemv","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float64/Level2.lean#L252-L275"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Level2.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat.gemvData_eq\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float64</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">gemvData_eq</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Mat.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Vec.html#BLAS.Float64.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float.html#Float\">Float</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">y</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Vec.html#BLAS.Float64.Vec\">Vec</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float64/Level2.html#BLAS.Float64.Mat.gemvData\">gemvData</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span> 